---
// Technical Arsenal Matrix Component — Swiss Division 03
---

<section id="arsenal" class="pt-12 pb-12 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-16 border-t border-theme-border space-y-8 scroll-mt-24">
  <!-- Section Heading — Swiss Division 03 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-theme-border pb-3 gap-3">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-accent font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase block">
        // COMPETENCIES &amp; STACK :: DIVISION 03
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg font-bold text-theme-primary mt-1">Technical Arsenal Matrix</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-muted">
      STACK_AUDIT: HIGH-CONCURRENCY DETERMINISTIC CORE
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4-Column Architectural Blueprint Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    <!-- Pillar 1: Fast Backends & APIs -->
    <div class="bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border p-5 rounded-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-theme-secondary transition-colors">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_01]</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Fast Backends &amp; APIs</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Rust (Axum, Tokio)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Java 21 (Spring Boot 3.4, Loom)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> WebSockets &amp; gRPC</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Python FastAPI</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#eff4ff] dark:bg-theme-surface p-3.5 border border-theme-border rounded-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary font-bold block mb-1">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU:</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted leading-relaxed">
          10k+ RPS throughput with zero memory leaks, slashing cloud server bills from $2,000/mo to a single $40/mo dedicated box.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Secure Databases & Data -->
    <div class="bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border p-5 rounded-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-theme-secondary transition-colors">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_02]</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Secure Databases &amp; Data</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> PostgreSQL 16 &amp; SeaORM</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Spring Data JPA &amp; Hibernate</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Redis In-Memory Caching</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> SQLite Edge Embedded Fallback</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#eff4ff] dark:bg-theme-surface p-3.5 border border-theme-border rounded-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary font-bold block mb-1">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU:</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted leading-relaxed">
          Bank-grade ACID transactions and zero data loss even during sudden power outages or network dropouts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3: Smart Hardware & IoT -->
    <div class="bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border p-5 rounded-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-theme-secondary transition-colors">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_03]</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Smart Hardware &amp; IoT</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> ZKTeco Biometrics ADMS Push SDK</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> RTSP AI Cameras &amp; YOLO OCR</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Barrier Gate Relays &amp; MCUs</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> RS485 / Serial / Modbus Protocols</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#eff4ff] dark:bg-theme-surface p-3.5 border border-theme-border rounded-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary font-bold block mb-1">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU:</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted leading-relaxed">
          Physical devices talk seamlessly to cloud or on-premise servers with sub-second response times and zero human intervention.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 4: Web & Cross-Platform -->
    <div class="bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border p-5 rounded-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-theme-secondary transition-colors">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_04]</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Web &amp; Cross-Platform</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> React 19 &amp; TypeScript</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Astro &amp; Tailwind CSS</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Flutter (iOS, Android, Windows)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-theme-accent">■</span> Three.js WebGL Runtimes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#eff4ff] dark:bg-theme-surface p-3.5 border border-theme-border rounded-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary font-bold block mb-1">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU:</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted leading-relaxed">
          Pixel-perfect, ultra-snappy 60fps native performance across all screens from field technician phones to command centers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
